WEBVTT

00:00:00.664 --> 00:00:05.212
Every project in FlightDeck is a git repository on the worker.

00:00:05.212 --> 00:00:08.512
Open a project shows all the ways to get one.

00:00:08.828 --> 00:00:13.287
Repositories already in the worker's projects folder are listed at the top.

00:00:13.573 --> 00:00:16.127
Browse opens any folder on the worker.

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:21.477
Clone takes a git URL, from GitHub or anywhere else the worker can reach.

00:00:21.779 --> 00:00:28.327
Or start from nothing. Pick the projects folder, give the new project a name, and Create.

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:37.196
FlightDeck creates the folder with a git repository and a first commit, and opens it.

00:00:37.196 --> 00:00:39.810
Add a remote when you're ready to push.

00:00:40.244 --> 00:00:43.170
Now the first agent can build the first version.

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:11.203
Done. Start it, and open it in the session's browser.

00:01:24.378 --> 00:01:29.208
From an empty folder to a working first version, without leaving FlightDeck.
